# Intentionally EMPTY. The real value is injected at image build time as a Railway build
# variable on the `web` service (frontend/Dockerfile declares `ARG VITE_API_BASE`), and a
# process env var wins over this file — verified, not assumed.
#
# It used to hold a hardcoded `https://api.springb.com/api/v1`: a domain nobody here owns,
# left over from the single-tenant build. In the real deploy Railway's value overrode it, so
# it never broke anything and nobody noticed — but any build without that variable would have
# silently shipped a bundle calling a stranger's host.
#
# Empty is the safe failure: with no API base the app falls into its bundled sample mode,
# which is obvious in the UI, instead of quietly talking to the wrong server.
VITE_API_BASE=
